      "writtenOn": "2017-08-01T06:27:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done changing to DOWNLOADING_IMAGE.\n\nSince the admin_state_fsm is called as post update callback of device object, the admin_state_fsm functions are pertaining to device object only. In my situation, I need download_image object as function input parameter so I used post update callback of download_image instead. Therefore admin_state_fsm from ENABLE to DOWNLOADING_IMAGE is no-op.",
      "parentUuid": "1a1a2d67_2d5f8174",
